                "claim": "The CI step test pins the workflow as text fragments (guard string, jq line, instance variable). It proves the step contains these strings but not that the shell runs correctly, for example the guard's basename comparison or the quoting. The L31/L32 log reports a manual run of the step body, so behavior was checked once, but nothing in the suite re-checks it. This is acceptable at the cheapest test level for a workflow file, so it is only a note.",
