                "severity": "SUGGESTION",
                "claim": "A claimed review_lens_count of 0 with no stored result now exits 6, where it passed at the baseline. This was asked for (A4) and is covered by TestLensCountOfZeroForAChangeWithNoStoredResultIsRefused, and the README and usage text were updated to match. Noted only because it is a contract tightening for any caller that wrote 0. I found no committed record or documented caller that does.",
